<title>SRI LANKA: Sri Lankan bourse closed for public holiday.</title>
<headline>Sri Lankan bourse closed for public holiday.</headline>
<dateline>COLOMBO 1996-08-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Colombo Stock Exchange is closed on Wednesday for a public holiday. The market will reopen on Thursday.</p>
<p>The all share index closed 0.14 points higher at 556.44 on Tuesday, when institutions focused their attention to the sale of a controlling stake in a plantation firm being privatised.</p>
<p>-- Colombo newsroom 941-434319</p>
</text>
